onsidered if they do not meet the minimum qualifications. The hiring department reviews the resumes and selects which applicants are selected for an interview. Candidates selected for an interview will be contacted by the hiring department. Thank you for your interest in San Francisco State University Employment Opportunities CSU Total Compensation (Projection - based on multiple factors) The Total Compensation Calculator demonstrates the significance of your CSU benefits package, and how it is an important complement to your salary. To see the total value of your benefits, simply choose the appropriate answers for your situation, fill-in your annual base salary, and press the \"Calculate\" button. CSU Total Compensation Calculator Annual Security Report Annual Fire Safety Report Contact Email: hrwww@sfsu.edu Telephone: 415.338.1872 / Fax: 415.338.0521 Need Assistance? Location San Francisco State University 1600 Holloway Avenue, ADM 252 San Francisco, CA 94132 Office Hours Monday through Friday 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Quick Links HR Client Support Center Calendar & Schedules FAQ's Forms SF State Gateway Accessibility Equity & Community Inclusion Environment & Sustainability Privacy Policy Title IX San Francisco State\n                            University A\n                            California State University Campus SF State Facebook SF State Twitter SF State Instagram SF State LinkedIn"
